# Rolling fast down a straight, plain slope never leaves the ground. Before the ground-support fix
# the neighbouring triangle's edge contact (same plane, up to 3 cm off) leaned the support normal up
# to 13 degrees at every triangle edge, and at 11+ m/s that threw the skater into 10-tick hops
# every few metres (the same glitch made the short airs on SoMa's flat runway).
park lab
spawn lab_hill_ten
cmd 6 speed 12
hold ollie 6..640
run 640
expect no event air within 40..640
expect skater.speed > 13.8 at 640
